			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Delegate AirClient and AirServiceProvider logic to AirLibrary crate\n\nFollowing the migration of the Air gRPC client and service provider logic to the dedicated `AirLibrary` crate, replace the Mountain-side implementations with thin compatibility shims. `AirClient` and `AirServiceProvider` are now type aliases to their canonical definitions in the `::AirLibrary::Client` namespace.\n\nIntroduce `MapAirError` in `AirClient.rs` to handle the translation between `::AirLibrary::AirError` and `CommonError`, ensuring that existing Mountain call sites can preserve their `Result<_, CommonError>` signatures. The `GenerateRequestID` helper is also updated to delegate to the new crate namespace.\n\nThis restructuring completes the extraction of Air-related logic into its own element, reducing code duplication and decoupling the daemon communication surface from the Mountain backend.",
			"SHA": "e3fadf040df9bd1cef2e59e6db7a41b974d6e510"
		},
